    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Shitambo mu witongeleja",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 8:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī mihayo ya shitambo īsho shikafunyiagwa mu myatīla ya witongeleja, ī yene pye a bose tūmanile gīkī twīdeebile; gwike ū būmani būkenhaga wikumīlīja, alīyo ū būtogwa būkazengaga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.8.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.8.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 8:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūlū munhū akwiganikaga gīkī amanile shose shose, ū ng'wenūyo ataalī ū kūmana ūmo shing'wigeleelilwe kūmana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.8.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.8.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 8:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ū munhū ūlū ūntogwa Mulungu, ū ng'wenūyo hū wamanagwa nū Mulungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.8.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.8.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 8:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna lūūlū, ī mihayo ya kūlya shilīwa īsho shikafunyiagwa kūbiza shitambo mu myatīla ya witongeleja; tūmanile gīkī ī shikolo īsho shikalamiagwa shitī na gose gose ū mu sī, na gīkī atīho Mulungu ūlū atī ūmò wike. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.8.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.8.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 8:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno nūūlū ni babiza balīho abo bakitanagwa bamulungu, hīmba ng'wigūlū nūūlū mu sī ūmu; gīt'ūmo ng'hana balīho “bamulungu” bingī, na “baseeba” bingī, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.8.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.8.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 8:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "alīyo ū kū bise ū Mulungu alī ūmò wike; hū ng'wene ū Sīswe. Hangī pyī ī shikolo shifumile kūlī wei, na a bise tūlī bakwe; hama alīho na Seeba ūmò Yesu Kilisito, ūyo pyī ī shikolo shilīho kūlwakwe, na a bise tūlīho kūlwakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.8.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.8.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 8:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwike ū būmani wenūbū būtīmo ū mu banhū pye a bose, balīho bangī kūlwa kūmanīīla myatīla ya witongeleja, nī haha ūlū balīlya bakabonaga gītī shafunyiagwa mu mbika ya witongeleja, na lūūlū ū mu gīko bakasosohalaga ū mu myoyo yabo nguno migokolo! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.8.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.8.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 8:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ī shilīwa shitīko kūtwenheleja kūkumīlījiwa na Mulungu, nguno nūūlū tūkaleka ū kūlya h'ītī gīkī tūkūgehelwa shose shose, hama nūūlū tūūlya nahene hū dūtūkūla no! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.8.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.8.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 8:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwike ilang'hanagi, ū būdūla wing'we wenūbū būtizūbiza ishikī ū kū bagokolo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.8.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.8.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 8:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno ū munhū ngokolo ūlū ūkūbona ū bebe ūyo ūlī na būmani wigashaga ng'widuku lya kūlamīja masamva, angū, atīko kūgima nang'hwe kūshisha nose alye shitambo īsho shafunyiagwa mu myatīla ya witongeleja? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.8.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.8.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 8:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kūlwa būmani wako ū bebe, ūkūbiza wankenaagūla ū ngokolo ng'wenūyo; ū ndūgū ūyo wachīlīlwa na Kilisito ng'wenūyo! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.8.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.8.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 8:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nose ūlū ng'ūbīītīla yabūbi gīko a badūgū, ūlū ng'wīlemehaja gīko ī myoyo ī migokolo, mukūbiza mulīng'hūba ū Kilisito. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.8.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.8.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 8:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hū kūhaya ūlū shilīwa shilīng'wenheleja ndūgū wane kwipama, nūūlū nyama nakūleka gete ilalī ū kūlya, natizūng'wipamya ū ndūgū wane.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.8.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.8.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
